[
  {
    "text": "日々の暮らしの織物",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.10166607057451951,
      "left": 0.3235293982843137,
      "width": 0.35294117941176395,
      "height": 0.030303029040404043
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "毎週土曜日の午前6時30",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.16446939418877496,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.21605879067696182,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "ックの荷下ろしを始める。この市",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.1871966659690781,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.2941176495098033,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "おり、近所の人によれば、70",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.2099239377493811,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.2616862520111117,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "分、最初の客が来るずっと前から、川辺市",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.16446939418877496,
      "left": 0.3337058318063741,
      "width": 0.36980390812091485,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "場の店主たちはトラ",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.16446939418877496,
      "left": 0.7035097399272889,
      "width": 0.17647058970588167,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "場は1948年からポプラ通りの4ブロックで開かれて",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.1871966659690781,
      "left": 0.41176470343137195,
      "width": 0.4566469048701036,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "年以上のあいだ一度も休んだことがないという。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.2099239377493811,
      "left": 0.37933329314052394,
      "width": 0.4313725707516325,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "現在の出店数は約140で、10",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.2449618150773482,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.26131366440408704,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "年前の85から大きく増えた。市の2023年の調査による",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.2449618150773482,
      "left": 0.3789607055334993,
      "width": 0.4903528924362758,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "と、通",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.2676890868576512,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.058823529901960686,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "常の週末には約12,000人が訪れ、地域経済に年間およそ4億2000万円の効果を",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.2676890868576512,
      "left": 0.17647058382352931,
      "width": 0.7049410686666697,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "もたらしている(",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.29041635863795434,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.1556862633660132,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "近",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.29041635863795434,
      "left": 0.27333331728758187,
      "width": 0.01960784330065354,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "くのカフェや商店の売り上げは含まない)",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.29041635863795434,
      "left": 0.29294116058823544,
      "width": 0.3719607864624176,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.29041635863795434,
      "left": 0.6599999776470586,
      "width": 0.014705873897059081,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "「みんな、私たちが野菜を売っていると思っているんです」と、ここで27年間青果店",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.32640120562343405,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.7475685846316995,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "を営む岡田真理子さんは言う。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.34912847740373704,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.2745098062091499,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "「本当に売っているのは、街の中心に出かける理由なん",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.34912847740373704,
      "left": 0.38725489268790825,
      "width": 0.48313722116830105,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "ですよ」",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.3718557491840401,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.07666666298202619,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "。一番の売れ筋は、今も1袋200円のミックスリーフだそうだ。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.3718557491840401,
      "left": 0.18941175534313734,
      "width": 0.5551371674330091,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "数字も彼女の言葉を裏付けている。市の開かれる日の歩行者数はほかの土曜日より",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.4068936265120072,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.7254902021241812,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "38%多く、来場者の4人に3人が近所の別の店にも立ち寄ったと答えた。県立大学の経",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.4296208982923102,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.7566469918799033,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "済学者である白井教授は、これを「波及効果」と呼んでいる。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.4523481700726133,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.5478430938398701,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "もちろん、良いことばかりではない。出店料は今年1月に1日3,500円から5,000円に",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.4873860474005805,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.7496077285702648,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "値上げされ、古くからの店主の中には負担が重いと話す人もいる。最も多い苦情は駐車",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.5101133191808834,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.7647058887254882,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "場だ。最寄りの公共駐車場は220台分しかなく、たいてい午前9時15分には満車にな",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.5328405909611865,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.7450586704264757,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "る。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.5555678627414895,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.03921568660130712,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "市議会は、5月1日から10月31日まで、さらに2ブロックを車両通行止めにする案を検",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.5915527097269694,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.7574705075318643,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "討している。賛成派は40店分のスペースが増えると主張し、反対派は配送や高齢者の",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.6142799815072724,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.7464313742908475,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "移動への影響を心配している。最近はQRコードで支払う若い客も増えた。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.6370072532875755,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.6565685519321913,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "今のところ、いつもの光景は変わらない。正午にはパンが売り切れ、花のバケツは半分",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.6720451306155426,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.7641176446323517,
      "height": 0.015151514520201985
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "空になり、噴水のそばではブラスバンド(退職した教",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.6947724023958456,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.46960784881535844,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "師5人組で、",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.6947724023958456,
      "left": 0.5872549027369272,
      "width": 0.11045095765277844,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "「セカンドウィンド」",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.6947724023958456,
      "left": 0.6928038993194443,
      "width": 0.1911764719362741,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "と名乗",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.7174996741761487,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.058823529901960686,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "っている)が演",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.7174996741761487,
      "left": 0.17647058382352931,
      "width": 0.13568627302287553,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "奏している。午後2時には、トラックは再び荷物でいっぱいにな",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.7174996741761487,
      "left": 0.31215685684640493,
      "width": 0.5610391347116037,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "る。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.7402269459564518,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.03921568660130712,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "通行止め計画に関する公聴会は、3月14日",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.7752648232844189,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.3729607305384002,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "る。意見書は今月末まで事務局で受け付けている。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.7979920950647219,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.450980395915032,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "(木)午後7時から市役所204号室で開かれ",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.7752648232844189,
      "left": 0.4906077844599689,
      "width": 0.3861568185915042,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
